{"q": 22851, "quiz": 2126, "obj": "P4.WORD_CHOICE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the end, Rania says, \"Fly safe, my godavan birds.\" Why does the writer use the word \"my\" here?", "why": "كلمة «my» تدلّ على تعلّقها بالطيور بعد أن حرستها طويلاً: «“Fly safe, my godavan birds,” yelled Rania.» ثم «“And come back soon.”»", "opts": [{"t": "It shows Rania's love for the birds.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "It shows Rania paid money for the birds.", "dx": "LITR", "key": false}, {"t": "It shows the birds live in Rania's house.", "dx": "LITR", "key": false}, {"t": "It shows Rania is angry with the birds.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
