{"q": 23315, "quiz": 2204, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The women met near the dry pond. What was their plan for the river?", "why": "في النص أعمال كثيرة تتنافس، والمطلوب خطة النهر: «If only they could cut the hill and make a path for it, the water would find its way to their pond.» أما «They build check dams to hold the rainwater.» فجاءت بعد ذلك.", "opts": [{"t": "Fill pots and buckets at the hand pump.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "Cut the hill and make a path for the water.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Dig a new well behind the big house.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Build check dams and hold the rainwater.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23316, "quiz": 2204, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Why does Maa go all the way to the hand pump at the landlord's fields?", "why": "السبب في الجملة التالية بلا أداة ربط: «She fills five pots and two buckets at the hand pump. The one near home has run out of water.»", "opts": [{"t": "The hand pump near her home is for men only.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The landlord pays her for the water.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The water at the landlord's fields is cleaner.", "dx": "GAP", "key": false}, {"t": "The hand pump near her home has no water.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
