{"q": 23320, "quiz": 2204, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "The men laugh and say, \"But what can women do?\" Does the story agree with the men?", "why": "القصة تردّ على سخرية الرجال بما فعلته النساء: «They carry spades and axes and shovels.» ثم «Together, they start digging.» ثم «They are building a waterway, they are inviting the river. And then it is done.»", "opts": [{"t": "No. The women dig a waterway with their own hands.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "Yes. The women wait for the men from the city.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The women stop their work on the first day.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. The women cut the hill with big excavators.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23423, "quiz": 2222, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Read the paragraph with the words \"We need our bats\". How do bats help?", "why": "في الجزء نفسه جملتان فيهما «pests»، والمطلوب جملة النفع: «Bats help keep pests under control, and in spreading seeds so that trees can grow.» أما «people mistakenly believe they are pests» فظنٌّ خاطئ.", "opts": [{"t": "They make lists of all the animals.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They control pests and spread seeds.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "They show the way to people with no sight.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "They are pests and eat the seeds.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 23424, "quiz": 2222, "obj": "P2.WORD_CONTEXT", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "Doctor Ella says, \"we use echolocation to find food\". What is echolocation?", "why": "المعنى من شرح الطبيبة بعد الكلمة: «We insect bats send out signals through our noses. These signals bounce off objects and become echoes. And the echoes come back and tell us what that object is,»", "opts": [{"t": "A chart with pictures of all the bats.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "A way to see food with very big eyes.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "A way to find things with signals and echoes.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "A medicine for the pain in a bat's ears.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
