{"q": 24316, "quiz": 2370, "obj": "P4.REASON_SUPPORTS", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "At the end, the book says, \"our story is a fantasy\". Does it give a good reason for this?", "why": "الادعاء «our story is a fantasy» وسببه بعده يسنده: «Passengers accelerating to this speed over a couple of hours would experience a force about a thousand times their weight.» ثم «Human bodies cannot withstand these forces.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. Black holes are only an idea from old stories.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. Human bodies cannot live through the forces of this trip.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "No. A rocket can already go to Pluto and back in a day.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. The facts about black holes in the story are all wrong.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}]},
{"q": 24959, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The writer tries to do many things with one hand. After that, what does the writer say about the new boy?", "why": "في الجملة قيدان يتنافسان — «some things» و«almost everything»: «I did realize that you have to do some things differently, but it’s not like you don’t do almost everything the rest of us do.»", "opts": [{"t": "He does everything differently from the rest of the class.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "He does everything with help from his mentor.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "He does some things differently, but he does almost everything.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "He does only easy things, like packing his bag.", "dx": "PART", "key": false}]},
{"q": 24960, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P2.UNSIGNALLED", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "At the end of the second letter, the writer says, \"This is all your fault.\" Why is the writer angry with the new boy?", "why": "السبب في الجمل السابقة بلا أداة ربط: «Gaurav, Ali and two of their friends from Class VII cornered me after school to ask about you- know-what.» ثم «They took my bag and wouldn’t give it back.» وبعدها «This is all your fault.»", "opts": [{"t": "Other children gave the writer trouble because of him.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "He threw the writer's bag into the thicket by the road.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "He tore the writer's shirt after school.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "He told a lie to the writer's friends.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 24961, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P2.ACROSS_PARA", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "The letters about the movie, the picnic and Annual Day are about many other things. Then the last letter says, \"I forgot all about it\". What does this show?", "why": "الدليل يُحمل من رسائل سابقة إلى الأخيرة: «the last couple of letters I wrote to you, I didn’t mention your prosthetic hand at all.» ثم «It’s like I forgot all about it and wanted to tell you so many other things.»", "opts": [{"t": "The new boy left the school before the movie day.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "The new hand is boring, so the writer says little about it.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The writer is still angry and says only bad things.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "The writer now thinks more about the boy than about his hand.", "dx": null, "key": true}]},
{"q": 24962, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P1.COMPETITOR", "kind": "mcq", "was": "sentence", "body": "In the Friend-o-Meter quiz, what does a score of 4-6 points say about you?", "why": "في آخر الاختبار ثلاث نتائج تتنافس، والمطلوب أولاها: «4-6 points: You are a born friend, always ready to lend a hand.»", "opts": [{"t": "You are always ready to help people.", "dx": null, "key": true}, {"t": "You are a little shy but kind-hearted.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}, {"t": "You help only after people ask you.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "You are independent and do not force people.", "dx": "MIX", "key": false}]},
{"q": 24963, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P3.ORDER", "kind": "relabel"},
{"q": 24964, "quiz": 2478, "obj": "P4.CRAFT_MOVE", "kind": "mcq", "was": "judge", "body": "The story is in letters, and they are only for the writer's own eyes. Does this help the reader see the change in the writer?", "why": "الرسائل لن تُقرأ: «And it’s not like you’re ever going to see this letter.» فيكتب الغضب صريحاً «This is all your fault.» ثم الاعتذار «Listen, I’m sorry about what I said earlier... about playing with us.»", "opts": [{"t": "Yes. The new boy answers each letter and tells his own side.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. The writer feels the same in the first letter and the last.", "dx": "REV", "key": false}, {"t": "No. Miss reads each letter, so the writer is not honest in them.", "dx": "JUMP", "key": false}, {"t": "Yes. The writer is honest in them, first angry and later sorry.", "dx": null, "key": true}]}
]$spec$::jsonb;
  e jsonb; o jsonb; r record;
  v_q bigint; v_obj bigint; v_id bigint; v_key bigint; v_dx jsonb; i int; n int;
  n_done int := 0; n_skip int := 0;
begin
  /* ── الحرّاس: كلُّ سؤالٍ في اختباره، من مكتبة المادّة ٧، وما يتحوّل بلا إجابة ── */
  for r in select (x->>'q')::bigint q, (x->>'quiz')::bigint quiz from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x loop
    if not exists (select 1 from questions qq join items it on it.quiz_id = qq.quiz_id join lessons l on l.id = it.lesson_id
                    join courses c on c.id = l.course_id
                    where qq.id = r.q and qq.quiz_id = r.quiz and c.subject_id = 7 and qq.retired_at is null) then
      raise exception 'السؤال % ليس في الاختبار % من مكتبة المادّة ٧', r.q, r.quiz;
    end if;
  end loop;
  select count(*) into n from answers a
   where a.question_id in (select (x->>'q')::bigint from jsonb_array_elements(spec) x where x->>'kind' <> 'relabel');
  if n > 0 then raise exception 'على الأسئلة % إجابة — لا يُحوَّل سؤالٌ أجاب عنه أحد', n; end if;

  for e in select * from jsonb_array_elements(spec) loop
    v_q := (e->>'q')::bigint;
    select kind, body, objective_id into r from questions where id = v_q;
    select id into strict v_obj from objectives where subject_id = 7 and code = e->>'obj';

    if e->>'kind' = 'relabel' then
      if r.objective_id is distinct from v_obj then update questions set objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q; n_done := n_done + 1;
      else n_skip := n_skip + 1; end if;
      continue;
    end if;

    if r.kind = e->>'kind' and r.body = e->>'body' then n_skip := n_skip + 1; continue; end if;
    if r.kind <> e->>'was' then raise exception 'السؤال % نمطُه % لا %', v_q, r.kind, e->>'was'; end if;

    update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null where question_id = v_q;
    delete from options where question_id = v_q;

    if e->>'kind' = 'mcq' then
      v_key := null; v_dx := '{}'::jsonb; i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'opts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body) values (v_q, i, o->>'t') returning id into v_id;
        if (o->>'key')::boolean then v_key := v_id;
        elsif o->>'dx' is not null then v_dx := v_dx || jsonb_build_object(v_id::text, o->>'dx'); end if;
      end loop;
      if v_key is null then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا مفتاح', v_q; end if;
      update questions set kind = 'mcq', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = v_key, correct_ids = null, accept = null, bank = null, wrong_map = null,
             dx_map = v_dx, explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    else   -- matching
      i := 0;
      for o in select * from jsonb_array_elements(e->'prompts') loop
        i := i + 1;
        insert into options (question_id, position, body, item_key) values (v_q, i, o->>'t', o->>'k');
      end loop;
      update questions set kind = 'matching', body = e->>'body', objective_id = v_obj, points = i where id = v_q;
      update question_keys set correct_id = null, correct_ids = null, wrong_map = null, dx_map = '{}'::jsonb,
             bank = e->'bank', accept = jsonb_build_object('pairs', e->'pairs'), explanation = e->>'why' where question_id = v_q;
    end if;
    get diagnostics n = row_count;
    if n <> 1 then raise exception 'السؤال % بلا سطر مفتاح', v_q; end if;
    n_done := n_done + 1;
  end loop;

  if n_done + n_skip <> 36 then raise exception 'عُدِّل % وتُخطّي % والمنتظر 36', n_done, n_skip; end if;
  raise notice '260: عُدِّل % سؤالاً · تُخطّي %', n_done, n_skip;
end $$;

insert into public.sql_log (n, title, applied_at)
values ('260', 'مكتبة بيان · المستوى الحادي عشر (الدفعة الرابعة): أسئلةُ الضغط والحكم تصير اختياراً من متعدّد', now())
on conflict (n) do update set applied_at = now();
